			],
			"Message": "style(Rest): Normalize shell script redirection spacing and indentation\n\nStandardize redirection operator spacing across Bench.sh, prepublishOnly.sh, and run_tests.sh by adding a space between operators and their targets (e.g. `2>/dev/null` to `2> /dev/null`, `>\"$output_dir\"` to `> \"$output_dir\"`, `<'\"$file\"` to `< \"$file\"`). Convert pipe chains in Bench.sh from end-of-line pipes to start-of-line pipes with backslash continuation. Indent case pattern labels in prepublishOnly.sh from flush-left to 4-space indent. Add spacing in heredoc redirects and delimiters (`>bin/Rest.js` to `> bin/Rest.js`, `<<'EOF'` to `<< 'EOF'`).\n\nThese are cosmetic-only changes with no functional impact. The bin/Rest binary is updated as a rebuild artifact.",
			"SHA": "b1e7f5ac5472a90f93211958c74800be3b8be310"
		},
