			"Message": "style(Rest): Normalize shell redirection spacing and case branch alignment\n\nStandardize shell script style across Bench.sh, prepublishOnly.sh, and run_tests.sh: remove the space between redirection operators and their targets (e.g. `2> /dev/null` to `2>/dev/null`, `> \"$output_dir\"` to `>\"$output_dir\"`, `< \"$file\"` to `<\"$file\"`, `> 'EOF'` to `>'EOF'`). Move continuation pipes from end-of-line to start-of-line in Bench.sh pipe chains. Flush-left all case pattern labels in prepublishOnly.sh to match the pattern-first style rather than indenting them 2-4 spaces.\n\nThese are cosmetic-only changes with no functional impact.",
